{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640040","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640040","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:0:1064004001:1":{"text":"As moonlight illuminates the sands in the Ashen Wastes, you collect the bones of some ancient desert beasts with Soren leading the way.","source_cn":"月光洒满荒角沙漠时，你们在索恩的带领下，获得了远古沙漠...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1064004002:1":{"text":"With the first ingredient of the Summoner's Stew ready, you bid farewell to Soren and Alsa the following morning.","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:2:1064004003:1":{"text":"Through Valen's connections, you secure a ship and embark on a sea voyage.","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"document:4:418:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">Ingredient 1: Ancient Bones</style>\nYou'll need bones from a creature that's lived a thousand years or more. The best ones come from desert monsters, as their bones have been soaking up the earth's essence for centuries. You must cut them under moonlight using silver tools.\nA note on sourcing: We do not recommend using your great-great-grandfather's remains, no matter how \"ancient\" they seem.\n \n<style=\"highlight\">Ingredient 2: Deepsea Liver</style>\nPicking the right organ is the tricky part. You want one from those ancient races that live in the deepest, darkest parts of the ocean.\nAfter collecting it, keep it submerged in water from its native environment. Do not let it get exposed to the air.","source_cn":"<style=\"highlight\">【材料一·远古生物骨骼】</style>\n远古生物骨骼必须来自存活超过千年的生物，沙漠巨兽最为理想，其骨骼经历漫长岁月吸收了大地精华。\n切割需在有月光的夜晚，使用银制工具，切忌使用铁器碰触。\n \n<style=\"highlight\">【材料二·海底生物的肝脏】</style>\n海底生物的肝脏选取尤为关键。应选择生活在海底的古老种族，越是不见天日者越佳。\n采集后的肝脏必须保存在原生环境的水中，切不可接触空气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE19C5B5C66C9B8FB","variant_status":"","male":"<style=\"highlight\">Ingredient 1: Ancient Bones</style>\nYou'll need bones from a creature that's lived a thousand years or more. The best ones come from desert monsters, as their bones have been soaking up the earth's essence for centuries. You must cut them under moonlight using silver tools.\nA note on sourcing: We do not recommend using your great-great-grandfather's remains, no matter how \"ancient\" they seem.\n \n<style=\"highlight\">Ingredient 2: Deepsea Liver</style>\nPicking the right organ is the tricky part. You want one from those ancient races that live in the deepest, darkest parts of the ocean.\nAfter collecting it, keep it submerged in water from its native environment. Do not let it get exposed to the air.","female":"<style=\"highlight\">Ingredient 1: Ancient Bones</style>\nYou'll need bones from a creature that's lived a thousand years or more. The best ones come from desert monsters, as their bones have been soaking up the earth's essence for centuries. You must cut them under moonlight using silver tools.\nA note on sourcing: We do not recommend using your great-great-grandfather's remains, no matter how \"ancient\" they seem.\n \n<style=\"highlight\">Ingredient 2: Deepsea Liver</style>\nPicking the right organ is the tricky part. You want one from those ancient races that live in the deepest, darkest parts of the ocean.\nAfter collecting it, keep it submerged in water from its native environment. Do not let it get exposed to the air.","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":"no_source_text"},"say:5:1064004004:0":{"text":"The liver of marine life... Isn't \"marine life\" a bit too vague?","source_cn":"海底生物的肝脏……这个范围也太广了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x404DA71EC218C584","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064004005:1":{"text":"What kind of creature should we use?","source_cn":"到底该选择什么生物呢？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x826F6DC22CECDE62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064004006:1":{"text":"How about a shark?","source_cn":"鲨鱼怎么样？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7F168C820FDC4733","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064004007:1":{"text":"The common species wouldn't cut it, I suppose.","source_cn":"普通海洋生物的肝脏应该不够格吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD5D8155327E4C1B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064004008:0":{"text":"The recipe specifies an ancient species that dwells in the depths of the ocean...","source_cn":"食谱上说要生活在海底的古老种族……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x99B12C74D06B9E1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064004009:1":{"text":"Any suggestions, Merlin?","source_cn":"梅林有什么建议吗？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x8351418F360661F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1064004009":{"text":"Any suggestions, Merlin?","source_cn":"梅林有什么建议吗？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x8351418F360661F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064004010:0":{"text":"Is it an intelligent species? No way! It's too cruel!","source_cn":"该不会是有智慧的魔物吧？……不行，那样太残酷了！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xE410D1C2EE957A1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064004011:0":{"text":"Hmm, what if it's a Mermaid?","source_cn":"唔，人鱼呢？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x6785CF04A05A0009","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064004012:0":{"text":"A hard no!","source_cn":"绝对不行！<key:dialog64>","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBF428993CE787FEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064004013:1":{"text":"Marcille's right—we agreed not to harm any demi-humans!","source_cn":"没错，我们说好不对亚人系生物下手的！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x2ECE1CBF1CFE6A67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1064004013":{"text":"Marcille's right—we agreed not to harm any demi-humans!","source_cn":"没错，我们说好不对亚人系生物下手的！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x2ECE1CBF1CFE6A67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064004014:0":{"text":"Ugh, just hearing the name makes me sick!","source_cn":"不要！听起来就很恶心！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xAC78BCFDCCC389C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1064004014":{"text":"Ugh, just hearing the name makes me sick!","source_cn":"不要！听起来就很恶心！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xAC78BCFDCCC389C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064004015:0":{"text":"Damedangler is just another name for a siren, right? That's why demi-humans are a no-go.","source_cn":"冥湾美人就是赛莲的别名对吧？我说亚人系的不行啊——","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x8275C550D2EA1727","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064004016:1":{"text":"Relax, the damedangler is a deep-sea fish.","source_cn":"不是啦，我们所说的冥湾美人其实是深海鱼。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7CCE00B52FD5C5E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064004017:1":{"text":"It looks nothing like a human! Actually, it's a bit scary.","source_cn":"外表和人完全不相似，反倒是有点令人毛骨悚然。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C6963DFA1709C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064004018:1":{"text":"Scary, huh... Are you sure it's okay?","source_cn":"毛骨悚然……真的没问题吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF375DCD6ADD7D33B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:28:1064004018":{"text":"Scary, huh... Are you sure it's okay?","source_cn":"虽说是鱼，但这么恐怖真的没问题吗？","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064004019:1":{"text":"How can we catch it then?","source_cn":"既然生活在深海里，我们该如何捕获它呢？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x97E7053F3F220235","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064004020:0":{"text":"We've caught some before. Just leave it to us!","source_cn":"主人和我们之前钓到过，交给我们吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA2AD30769D75EB24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064004021:1":{"text":"Drawing from your previous experiences, you prepare the special bait and cast your rod in the area where damedanglers are most commonly found.","source_cn":"你们根据之前的经历，准备好了特制的饵蚯，并在它常出没的...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064004022:1":{"text":"Still no luck?","source_cn":"唉，还要等多久？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x2719302B5107FD9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064004023:1":{"text":"Chilchuck, fishing is all about patience.","source_cn":"齐尔查克，钓鱼要耐心。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x429012AACEF33400","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064004024:1":{"text":"Fine, I'll wait...","source_cn":"好吧，我等……就……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF91DCED284B4B1CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064004025:0":{"text":"Chilchuck! Chilchuck!","source_cn":"齐尔查克！齐尔查克！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE633F0961F9A0004","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064004026:0":{"text":"Sounds like someone's singing.","source_cn":"好像有什么歌声传了过来。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF226B479B285FF15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064004027:1":{"text":"This is... a Mermaid! They're trying to lure us out.","source_cn":"我明白了，是人鱼——她们试图引诱我们！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4B6A3D119936CD80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064004028:0":{"text":"Trust me, I can handle this! La la lu lu woo wah wah—","source_cn":"交给我，我有办法！啦啦啊啊啊呜哇哇——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xDD10101C1BE3AFF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:49:1064004029:1":{"text":"By the time Laios had finished singing to the end, the Mermaids have fled the area in fear.","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:50:1064004030:1":{"text":"But those on the ship have nowhere to escape...","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064004031:0":{"text":"I... I can't take it anymore...","source_cn":"窝……窝不行了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x22D3B75234EFDC77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064004032:1":{"text":"I'm about to throw up, but not because I'm seasick...","source_cn":"我要吐了，但不是因为晕船……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x47160241F3989E27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064004033:1":{"text":"...Was it that bad?","source_cn":"……真的有这么难听吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAF93FE932654021A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:57:1064004033":{"text":"...Was it that bad?","source_cn":"……真的有这么难听吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAF93FE932654021A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064004034:1":{"text":"(Whispering) Is it the damedangler?","source_cn":"（小声）是……冥湾美人上钩了吗？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xC69F4EFA63C7E5C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064004035:1":{"text":"I saw it! It moved! The fish bit the bait!","source_cn":"动了！动了！上钩了——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5AAD6A0939D81019","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064004036:0":{"text":"Despite the damedangler's fierce resistance, you manage to tame it and reel it in.","source_cn":"虽然冥湾美人在剧烈挣扎，但你们仍然成功钓到了它。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x501A8F0F09B371FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064004037:1":{"text":"...So ugly.","source_cn":"……好丑。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3CC04DA2FCA96902","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:66::2":{"text":"","source_cn":"","status":"matched_item_resource","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064004038:1":{"text":"...It doesn't deserve such a nice name at all.","source_cn":"……和名字好有反差感。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xDA579839EEC9C912","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064004039:0":{"text":"Maybe it's beautiful in the eyes of other fish! Look at its sharp teeth, elegant light, and rough scales...","source_cn":"说不定在深海里，这确实是美人。看看这锋利的尖牙，这优雅...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:71:1064004040:0":{"text":"And its torn tail fin...","source_cn":"还有破损的尾鳍……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x80DE10298D8A8C4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064004041:1":{"text":"Um, does its tail fin always carry a giant clam?","source_cn":"呃，夹着巨蚌的尾鳍也是特征之一吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD6439991AD972107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:73:1064004042:1":{"text":"Of course not, duh!","source_cn":"想也知道不可能吧！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE052ACF851E9BDB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:57:0:1":{"text":"Shh... The rod just moved!","source_cn":"嘘——鱼竿有动静了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x368FE889563D1CB8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Shh... The rod just moved!","female":"Shh... The rod just moved!","variant_male_record_index":"60406","variant_female_record_index":"60407","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:0:1":{"text":"It's a deep-sea fish, we'll have to overlook its appearance.","source_cn":"毕竟是深海鱼，长成这样也没办法","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0DCCF11C799FAADC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's a deep-sea fish, we'll have to overlook its appearance.","female":"It's a deep-sea fish, we'll have to overlook its appearance.","variant_male_record_index":"60404","variant_female_record_index":"60405","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:0:1":{"text":"Maybe it's the damedangler.","source_cn":"或许还有一种选择——冥湾美人","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2BA1DED3E82280D7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Maybe it's the damedangler.","female":"Maybe it's the damedangler.","variant_male_record_index":"60402","variant_female_record_index":"60403","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:0:1":{"text":"Or... the Plague Creeper?","source_cn":"或者……腐臭瘴泥？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD41B6D2CEC86F823","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Or... the Plague Creeper?","female":"Or... the Plague Creeper?","variant_male_record_index":"60400","variant_female_record_index":"60401","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_t